  "caveats": [
    "Grid omission is a leave-one-shared-source-out sensitivity, not a CI or p-value.",
    "Each 0.25-degree ERA5 source grid can represent multiple monitored site IDs; remaining grids may still be spatially correlated.",
    "Strict September count cohort retains only three regions, 187 of 203 comparison intervals in Victoria Land.",
    "Season-over-season delta in September 2m temperature is short-term weather, not long-run climate-forcing attribution.",
    "Site-only and site-plus-year slopes are of opposite sign, so neither is an identified general warming effect.",
    "No land availability, breeding success, movement, predation, or greening mechanism was tested."
  ]
